You can use the "which" function to avoid having the missing values carried through. For example:

x = c(5, NA, 7, 2, 3, NA, 8)

x[x<4]
[1] NA  2  3 NA

x[which(x<4)]
[1] 2 3

x[x==3]
[1] NA  3 NA

x[which(x==3)]
[1] 3

Joel

